 "sections": [
  {
   "id": "yb-6-8-algo",
   "h": "Algorithm: Venous thrombosis (Virchow triad)",
   "html": "<div class=\"flow\" data-flow=\"y68a\"></div><ul><li><b>Presentation</b>: Deep venous thrombosis, Pulmonary embolism</li><li><b>Etiology</b>: จำแนกได้ 3 กลุ่มตาม “Virchow triad” — 1. Venous stasis 2. Vascular injury 3. Hypercoagulable state</li></ul>"
  },
  {
   "id": "yb-6-8-stasis",
   "h": "1. Venous stasis",
   "html": "<ul><li>Immobilization</li><li>Fracture: hip, knee</li><li>Spinal cord injury</li><li>Surgery<ul><li>Major surgery</li><li>Orthopaedic surgery</li></ul></li></ul>"
  },
  {
   "id": "yb-6-8-injury",
   "h": "2. Vascular injury",
   "html": "<ul><li>Varicose vein</li><li>Venous vascular anomalies</li><li>Buerger’s disease</li></ul>"
  },
  {
   "id": "yb-6-8-hyper",
   "h": "3. Hypercoagulable state “Thrombophilia”",
   "html": "<p>แบ่งเป็น Congenital และ Acquire</p>",
   "sub": [
    {
     "id": "yb-6-8-cong",
     "h": "Congenital",
     "html": "<ul><li>Antithrombin deficiency</li><li>Protein C deficiency</li><li>Protein S deficiency</li><li>Factor V Leiden</li><li>Homocystinuria</li><li>Prothrombin G2010A</li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "id": "yb-6-8-acq",
     "h": "Acquire",
     "html": "<p>Active Malignancy · Hematologic disease · Medication · Autoimmune · Miscellaneous</p>",
     "sub": [
      {
       "id": "yb-6-8-heme",
       "h": "Hematologic disease",
       "html": "<p><u>Myeloproliferative disease</u></p><ul><li>PV</li><li>ET</li></ul><p><u>Other</u></p><ul><li>DIC, TTP, PNH</li><li>HIT</li><li>Leukemia</li><li>Waldenstrom Macroglobulinemia</li></ul>"
      },
      {
       "id": "yb-6-8-med",
       "h": "Medication",
       "html": "<p><b>Hormone</b></p><ul><li>Estrogen</li><li>Progesterone</li><li>Oral contraceptive pill</li></ul><p><b>SERM</b></p><p><b>Chemotherapy</b></p><ul><li>L-asparginase</li><li>Thalidomide</li><li>Antiangiogenesis</li></ul>"
      },
      {
       "id": "yb-6-8-auto",
       "h": "Autoimmune",
       "html": "<ul><li>Antiphospholipid syndrome</li><li>SLE</li></ul>"
      },
      {
       "id": "yb-6-8-misc",
       "h": "Miscellaneous",
       "html": "<ul><li>Nephrotic syndrome</li><li>Pregnancy</li><li>HIV infection</li></ul>"
      }
